  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lar gabbon protection in the Western Forest Complex, Thailand - Year 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives of this project are to maintain the SMART patrol system in Huai Kha Khaeng Wildlife Sanctuary (HKK) to the current intensity and coverage, build on Year 1 of the project, and establish a baseline population estimate for lar gibbon in the southern area of HKK.</narrative>
  </description>
